#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:1
msgid "概念：环境包与 manifest"
msgstr "Concept: Environment packages and the manifest"

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:3
msgid "一次成功的构建产生一个**自包含、可移植**的目录，恰好包含六个契约文件："
msgstr "A successful build produces a **self-contained, portable** directory containing exactly six contract files:"

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:14
msgid "`environment.yaml`：命名不可变的包成员，声明 Gymnasium 接口行为。"
msgstr "`environment.yaml`: names the immutable package members and declares Gymnasium interface behavior."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:15
msgid "`physics.h5`：点身份加响应数据，或导体几何。"
msgstr "`physics.h5`: point identity plus response data, or conductor geometry."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:16
msgid "`hardware.yaml`：冻结的有序通道约束。"
msgstr "`hardware.yaml`: frozen, ordered channel constraints."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:17
msgid "`scenario.h5`：外部场与位姿帧。"
msgstr "`scenario.h5`: external-field and pose frames."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:18
msgid "`manifest.json`：记录 schema 版本、来源身份、坐标框架、数组形状、通道顺序和每个成员的 SHA-256。"
msgstr "`manifest.json`: records schema versions, source identities, coordinate frame, array shapes, channel order, and the SHA-256 of every member."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:20
msgid "包的性质："
msgstr "Package properties:"

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:22
msgid "缺少、多余、重排或被改动的成员都让校验失败；分析文件放在包旁边而不是里面。"
msgstr "A missing, extra, reordered, or modified member fails validation; keep analysis files beside the package, not inside it."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:23
msgid "导出是原子的：要么完整写出，要么不写；不覆盖已有目录。"
msgstr "Export is atomic: either the complete package is written or nothing is; existing directories are never overwritten."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:24
msgid "`make_env` 只读这个包，不接触任何原始构建源。"
msgstr "`make_env` reads only this package and never touches original build sources."

#: ../../concepts/environment-package.md:26
msgid "六文件之外的任何内容（说明文件、修改过的字节、编辑过的 manifest）都会破坏校验，这是刻意的不变量。"
msgstr "Anything beyond the six files (notes, modified bytes, edited manifest) breaks validation; this is an intentional invariant."
